  "goodToKnow": "Die Dichtung has two meanings. In literature, it's poetry or literary writing: die deutsche Dichtung, Dichtung und Wahrheit (the title of Goethe's autobiography). Der Dichter is a poet, and dichten means to write poetry. In plumbing and engineering, die Dichtung is a seal or gasket, from dicht (tight, watertight): Die Dichtung tropft. Germany calls itself das Land der Dichter und Denker. Plural: die Dichtungen."
